    description: "Re-run only the cohorts that contain repos affected by fixes from rounds 1 and 2.\n\nOptions:\na) Init a new session and add only the affected cohorts\nb) Re-iterate the existing session (the bakeoff-features CLI supports multiple iterations\n   per cohort via iter-001, iter-002, etc.)\n\nFor each affected cohort: run, diagnose, reflect.\n\nDo NOT re-run the entire 41-repo curriculum — only cohorts with repos where fixes changed\nbehavior. If fixes only affected Rust analysis and Cohort 0 (formal methods) had no Rust\nrepos, skip Cohort 0.\n\nIf fix rounds 1 and 2 produced zero fixes, close this item as \"no re-run needed.\""  # 9adb
